351 Almare - Where Comfort Meets the Atlantic

Between the serenity of the ocean and the authenticity of Viana do Castelo, 351 Almare was born, a residential development that redefines the concept of comfort, elegance and quality of life.

Just 5 minutes from Praia do Rodanho, this project was carefully designed for those looking for an exclusive lifestyle, where contemporary architecture, natural light and proximity to the sea come together in a truly differentiated experience.

The private condominium includes 67 apartments of different types, T1 and T2, spread across large and functional spaces, designed to privilege well-being and everyday sophistication. With areas between 42 m² and 116 m², all houses have generous panoramic balconies, creating a harmonious connection between internal and external spaces and providing an environment of tranquility in all seasons of the year.

Every detail has been thought out to offer a high standard of quality. The interiors are distinguished by selected materials, excellent finishes, fully equipped kitchens, highly energy efficient solutions and superior thermal and acoustic insulation, ensuring comfort, functionality and durability.

Outside, residents enjoy a reserved and exclusive environment, where the swimming pool, large green spaces and common areas invite rest, socializing and permanent contact with nature.

The location of 351 Almare constitutes one of its greatest attributes. Located in one of the most sought after areas of Viana do Castelo, it benefits from the proximity of Praia do Rodanho, recognized for its natural beauty and excellent conditions for surfing, kitesurfing, paddleboarding, sailing and other nautical activities. At the same time, it is just a few minutes from the city center, the main roads, educational establishments, commerce, restaurants and services, providing simple and efficient mobility.

More than a development, 351 Almare represents a solid investment in a location that is continually increasing in value, bringing together all the characteristics that distinguish excellent properties: contemporary architecture, construction quality, energy efficiency, exclusivity and an incomparable natural environment.

Project Highlights:

 Private condominium with swimming pool and large green spaces;

 67 apartments of types T0, T1 and T2;

 Areas between 42 m² and 116 m²;

 Panoramic balconies in all units;

 Fully equipped kitchens;

 High quality finishes;

 High thermal and acoustic performance;

 Private parking;

 Just 5 minutes from Praia do Rodanho;

 Excellent access to the center of Viana do Castelo and the A28;

 Ideal for permanent residence, second home or investment.

351 Almare is the perfect balance between the refinement of contemporary architecture, the tranquility of a private condominium and the freedom of living along the Atlantic.

A place designed for those looking for more than a house: they are looking for a lifestyle.

